{% macro language_name(language=none) %}{{ "Simplified Chinese" if (language or (output_language | default("en"))) == "zh" else "Australian English" }}{% endmacro %}
{% macro narrative_language() %}
## Output language

Working language: {{ language_name() }}.
- Write every free-text field (conclusions, reasoning steps, counter-arguments, reasons, notes and narrative) in {{ language_name() }}.
- Do not translate quotations from documents: keep them in quotation marks, in their original language. Keep the names of the client, counterparties and people, account names and the wording of standards exactly as they appear in the inputs.
- Copy field values that the instructions above give in quotation marks (for example `account` "Cash") exactly as given; do not translate them.
- Keep JSON keys, enum values, IDs and pointer fields (`source_type`, `source_id`, `locator`, `page`) exactly as specified above.
