{% macro extraction_language(explained) %}
## Output language

Working language: {{ language_name() }}.
- Copy every value taken from the inputs (names, addresses, clause text, account numbers, headings and cell text) exactly as written, in its original language, apart from the formatting the rules above require (amounts, dates, digits-only numbers, name order, generated column names such as `Column n`): do not translate or reword it.
- Copy field values that the instructions above give in quotation marks exactly as given; do not translate them.
{% if explained %}
- Write only the explanatory field{{ "s" if explained | length > 1 }} `{{ explained | join("`, `") }}` in {{ language_name() }}.
{% else %}
- This output has no explanatory field: every field is a value taken from the inputs.
{% endif %}
- Keep JSON keys, enum values, IDs and pointer fields (`source_type`, `source_id`, `locator`, `page`) exactly as specified above.
